濃膩。\n\n另外溏心蛋的熟度非常完美，也有淡淡的香氣。\n叉燒的配置份量得宜 也沒有豬/雞的肉臭味。\n\n看到某樓評論說偏台式雞湯，看了也是笑笑的，\n不懂真的別裝懂，人家明明跟在日本吃到的店家 相去不遠啦說實話。\n而且其實以現今2026來說 價格也還能接受，是個很值得推薦的好店家 東湖人的驕傲👍🏻",null,[0,57]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12162121501427268541/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3YzFSSFNrWlVNRTR6VjJ4c2JrMXRSbmhaYTFwRVVqQTBNbUpZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3547,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wc1RHSkZUME4zV2xsbk1tRnhZa1pEUjA0MmJYYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa61ac0ae9be5870b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmpsTGJFT0N3WllnMmFxYkZDR042bXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wc1RHSkZUME4zV2xsbk1tRnhZa1pEUjA0MmJYYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wc1RHSkZUME4zV2xsbk1tRnhZa1pEUjA0MmJYYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wc1RHSkZUME4zV2xsbk1tRnhZa1pEUjA0MmJYYxILMGVDVmV0WDZ0NjMaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tcHNUR0pGVDBOM1dsbG5NbUZ4WWtaRFIwNDJiWGMSCzBlQ1